~ next
Micah: Anyway, Sarah's got to stay inside today. Shopkeeper's orders. Not exactly sure why. 
Micah: I got some errands to run for the Elders so I gotta get going in a minute. Will you tell her I figured out where to get the final piece for her father's gift? 
- Sure. 
	Micah: [#sprite=happy]Thanks much!
	Micah: [#sprite=happy]Gotta go now. See you tomorrow!
	- See you. => END1 
	- Bye, Micah. => END1 
